        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Levantar La Botella&quot; means &quot;stand the bottle&quot;, a classic Taiwanese night market game where you use a ring hanging from a stick to skilfully lift a bottle into a standing position.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is famously addictive at the night market, so I thought: why not turn it into a game? Now, I can relive the fun anytime, anywhere — and so can you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is my love letter 💌 to my home country. I hope you enjoy playing it as much as I enjoyed making it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+-------------------+--------------------------+--------------------+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Control                   | Action                             | Keys                       |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+-------------------+--------------------------+--------------------+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Tilt The Handle      | Left, Right                       | Q, E                        |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >|                                | Up, Down                        | W, S                       |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >|                                | Forward, Backward         | A, D                        |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+-------------------+--------------------------+--------------------+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Move                      | Forward, Backward         | UP ↑, DOWN ↓        |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >|                                | Left, Right                       | LEFT ←, RIGHT →  |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+-------------------+--------------------------+---------------------+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Camera                  | Look around                    | Mouse 🖱                |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+-------------------+--------------------------+---------------------+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Levantar La Botella&quot; means &quot;stand the bottle&quot;, a classic Taiwanese night market game where you use a ring hanging from a stick to skilfully lift a bottle into a standing position.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is famously addictive at the night market, so I thought: why not turn it into a game? Now, I can relive the fun anytime, anywhere — and so can you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is my love letter 💌 to my home country. I hope you enjoy playing it as much as I enjoyed making it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+-------------------+--------------------------+--------------------+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Control                   | Action                             | Keys                       |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+-------------------+--------------------------+--------------------+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Tilt The Handle      | Left, Right                       | Q, E                        |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >|                                | Up, Down                        | W, S                       |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >|                                | Forward, Backward         | A, D                        |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+-------------------+--------------------------+--------------------+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Move                      | Forward, Backward         | UP ↑, DOWN ↓        |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >|                                | Left, Right                       | LEFT ←, RIGHT →  |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+-------------------+--------------------------+---------------------+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >| Camera                  | Look around                    | Mouse 🖱                |</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+-------------------+--------------------------+---------------------+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
